So the defect is confined to the **4-host `ovs4` fabric**. It does NOT invalidate results taken
on the 128-host OVS path, which are independently clean (the two-plane ceiling figure's OVS half
reads qdisc interface counters and never goes through the twin; the bmv2 fig8 OVS points come
from the 128 path and are iperf3 throughput).
The affected population is exactly: rounds that read TWIN TELEMETRY on an `ovs4` fabric.
FIX SPEC, which is why the narrowing raises this finding's value rather than lowering it:
ovs_4host_topo.py needs the enable_sflow() call its sibling reference topology already has.
